  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding contribution to the Office of the UN High Commissioner for Human Rights - Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides core support to UNOHCHR Cambodia, to implement activities related to its 2024-2028 Management Plan. 

The Management Plan identifies four strategic priority areas: 

Mechanisms: Increase implementation of the outcomes of the international human rights mechanisms 

Participation: Enhance participation and protect civic space 

Development: Advance sustainable development through human rights 

Accountability: Strengthen the rule of law and accountability for human rights violations</narrative>
  </description>
